## 第五章 系统实现

### 5.1 RAG问答模块实现

#### 5.1.1 简单对话实现

简单对话功能通过Spring AI的ChatClient实现，支持流式输出和对话历史管理。

```java
@Override
public Flux<ChatResponse> simpleChat(ChatMessageVO chatMessageVO) {
    ChatModel chatModel = llmService.getChatModel();
    ChatClient chatClient = ChatClient.builder(chatModel).build();

    return chatClient.prompt().user(user -> {
                user.param(CHAT_CONVERSATION_NAME, chatMessageVO.getConversationId());
                user.text(chatMessageVO.getContent());
            })
            .advisors(new MessageChatMemoryAdvisor(databaseChatMemory, 
                chatMessageVO.getConversationId(), CHAT_MAX_LENGTH))
            .stream()
            .chatResponse();
}
```

**实现要点：**

1. **模型选择**：使用轻量级对话模型进行简单对话，降低响应延迟
2. **对话记忆**：通过MessageChatMemoryAdvisor实现对话历史管理，保持上下文连贯性
3. **流式输出**：使用Flux响应式流，实现逐字输出效果，提升用户体验
4. **会话隔离**：通过conversationId区分不同会话，确保对话历史不混淆

#### 5.1.2 RAG对话实现

RAG对话是系统的核心功能，实现了检索增强的问答能力。

```java
@Override
public Flux<ChatResponse> simpleRAGChat(ChatMessageVO chatMessageVO, List<String> baseIds) {
    ChatModel chatModel = llmService.getChatModel();
    ChatClient chatClient = ChatClient.builder(chatModel).build();
    PromptTemplate template = new PromptTemplate(ragPromptResource);
    String ragTemplate = template.getTemplate();

    // 构建向量查询条件
    SearchRequest searchRequest = SearchRequest.defaults()
            .withTopK(RAG_TOP_K)
            .withQuery(chatMessageVO.getContent())
            .withFilterExpression(buildBaseAccessFilter(baseIds));

    return chatClient.prompt().user(user -> {
                user.param(CHAT_CONVERSATION_NAME, chatMessageVO.getConversationId());
                user.text(chatMessageVO.getContent());
            })
            .advisors(new SimpleLoggerAdvisor(),
                    new QuestionAnswerAdvisor(llmService.getVectorStore(), 
                        searchRequest, ragTemplate),
                    new MessageChatMemoryAdvisor(databaseChatMemory, 
                        chatMessageVO.getConversationId(), CHAT_MAX_LENGTH)
            )
            .stream()
            .chatResponse();
}
```

**实现流程：**

1. **问题接收**：接收用户问题和知识库ID列表
2. **向量检索**：将问题转换为向量，在向量数据库中检索相似文档
3. **权限过滤**：通过FilterExpressionBuilder构建权限过滤条件，确保只检索指定知识库的文档
4. **上下文构建**：使用QuestionAnswerAdvisor将检索结果插入到提示模板中
5. **答案生成**：调用大语言模型生成回答，流式返回结果

#### 5.1.3 带引用的RAG对话实现

为了增强回答的可信度和可追溯性，系统实现了带引用来源的RAG对话功能。

```java
public Flux<ChatResponseWithReferencesVO> simpleRAGChatWithReferences(
        ChatMessageVO chatMessageVO, List<String> baseIds) {
    ChatModel chatModel = llmService.getChatModel();
    ChatClient chatClient = ChatClient.builder(chatModel).build();
    PromptTemplate template = new PromptTemplate(ragPromptResource);
    String ragTemplate = template.getTemplate();

    // 构建向量查询条件
    SearchRequest searchRequest = SearchRequest.defaults()
            .withTopK(RAG_TOP_K)
            .withQuery(chatMessageVO.getContent())
            .withFilterExpression(buildBaseAccessFilter(baseIds));

    // 先执行向量检索获取引用文档
    List<Document> retrievedDocs = llmService.getVectorStore()
            .similaritySearch(searchRequest);
    List<ChatResponseWithReferencesVO.DocumentReferenceVO> references = 
            extractReferences(retrievedDocs);

    // 执行RAG对话并返回带引用的结果
    return chatClient.prompt().user(user -> {
                user.param(CHAT_CONVERSATION_NAME, chatMessageVO.getConversationId());
                user.text(chatMessageVO.getContent());
            })
            .advisors(new SimpleLoggerAdvisor(),
                    new QuestionAnswerAdvisor(llmService.getVectorStore(), 
                        searchRequest, ragTemplate),
                    new MessageChatMemoryAdvisor(databaseChatMemory, 
                        chatMessageVO.getConversationId(), CHAT_MAX_LENGTH)
            )
            .stream()
            .chatResponse()
            .map(chatResponse -> {
                ChatResponseWithReferencesVO vo = new ChatResponseWithReferencesVO();
                vo.setContent(chatResponse.getResult().getOutput().getContent());
                vo.setReferences(references);
                return vo;
            });
}
```

**引用信息提取：**

```java
private List<ChatResponseWithReferencesVO.DocumentReferenceVO> 
        extractReferences(List<Document> documents) {
    Set<Long> documentIds = new HashSet<>();
    List<ChatResponseWithReferencesVO.DocumentReferenceVO> references = new ArrayList<>();

    for (Document doc : documents) {
        Map<String, Object> metadata = doc.getMetadata();
        
        // 过滤低相似度文档
        if (metadata.containsKey("distance")) {
            double distance = Double.parseDouble(metadata.get("distance").toString());
            if (distance > 0.5) continue;  // 只保留高相似度文档
        }

        // 提取文档元数据
        if (metadata.containsKey("document_id")) {
            Long docId = Long.parseLong(metadata.get("document_id").toString());
            if (!documentIds.contains(docId)) {
                documentIds.add(docId);
                DocumentEntity documentEntity = documentEntityMapper.selectById(docId);
                KnowledgeBase knowledgeBase = knowledgeBaseMapper
                    .selectById(documentEntity.getBaseId());
                
                // 构建引用信息
                ChatResponseWithReferencesVO.DocumentReferenceVO ref = 
                    new ChatResponseWithReferencesVO.DocumentReferenceVO();
                ref.setDocumentId(docId);
                ref.setDocumentName(documentEntity.getFileName());
                ref.setKnowledgeBaseName(knowledgeBase.getName());
                ref.setContentType(metadata.get("content_type").toString());
                
                // 根据内容类型获取详细信息
                if ("article".equals(ref.getContentType())) {
                    Content content = contentService.getById(contentId);
                    ref.setTitle(content.getTitle());
                    ref.setAuthor(content.getCreator());
                } else if ("comment".equals(ref.getContentType())) {
                    Comment comment = commentService.getById(contentId);
                    ref.setTitle(comment.getContent().substring(0, 30) + "...");
                    ref.setAuthor(comment.getAuthor());
                }
                references.add(ref);
            }
        }
    }
    return references;
}
```

#### 5.1.4 提示词模板设计

系统使用结构化的提示词模板引导大语言模型生成准确回答。

**RAG提示词模板（prompt/RAG.txt）：**

```
## 指令设置开始 ##

### 第一身份定义 ###
作为一个精确的RAG系统助手，请严格按照以下指南回答用户问题：
    1. 仔细分析问题，识别关键词和核心概念。
    2. 从提供的上下文中精确定位相关信息，优先使用完全匹配的内容。
    3. 构建回答时，确保包含所有必要的关键词，提高关键词评分。
    4. 保持回答与原文的语义相似度，以提高向量相似度评分。
    5. 控制回答长度，理想情况下不超过参考上下文长度的1.5倍。
    6. 对于表格查询或需要多段落/多文档综合的问题，给予特别关注。
    7. 如果上下文信息不足，可以进行合理推理，但要明确指出。
    8. 回答应简洁、准确、完整，直接解答用户问题。
    9. 不要输出"根据提供的信息"等前缀修饰句，直接输出答案。

### 信息补充 ###

    参考上下文：
```
    {question_answer_context}
    ```
### 要求 ###

    请提供准确、相关且简洁的回答。

## 指令设置完毕 ##
```

### 5.2 知识库管理模块实现

#### 5.2.1 知识库CRUD实现

知识库管理提供了知识库的增删改查功能。

```java
@Service
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class KnowledgeBaseServiceImpl implements KnowledgeBaseService {
    
    private final KnowledgeBaseMapper knowledgeBaseMapper;

    @Override
    public Boolean addKnowledgeBase(KnowledgeBaseVO knowledgeBaseVO) {
        KnowledgeBase knowledgeBase = new KnowledgeBase();
        BeanUtils.copyProperties(knowledgeBaseVO, knowledgeBase);
        knowledgeBase.setId(UUID.randomUUID().toString());
        knowledgeBase.setCreateTime(LocalDateTime.now());
        knowledgeBase.setUpdateTime(LocalDateTime.now());
        return knowledgeBaseMapper.insert(knowledgeBase) > 0;
    }

    @Override
    public Boolean updateKnowledgeBase(KnowledgeBaseVO knowledgeBaseVO) {
        KnowledgeBase knowledgeBase = new KnowledgeBase();
        BeanUtils.copyProperties(knowledgeBaseVO, knowledgeBase);
        knowledgeBase.setUpdateTime(LocalDateTime.now());
        return knowledgeBaseMapper.updateById(knowledgeBase) > 0;
    }

    @Override
    public Boolean deleteKnowledgeBase(String id) {
        return knowledgeBaseMapper.deleteById(id) > 0;
    }

    @Override
    public List<KnowledgeBaseVO> KnowledgeList() {
        List<KnowledgeBase> list = knowledgeBaseMapper.selectList(null);
        return list.stream().map(item -> {
            KnowledgeBaseVO vo = new KnowledgeBaseVO();
            BeanUtils.copyProperties(item, vo);
            return vo;
        }).collect(Collectors.toList());
    }
}
```

#### 5.2.2 文档管理实现

文档管理提供了文档列表查询、删除、下载等功能。

```java
@Service
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class DocumentEntityServiceImpl implements DocumentEntityService {

    private final DocumentEntityMapper documentEntityMapper;
    private final OriginFileResourceMapper originFileResourceMapper;
    private final LLMService llmService;

    @Override
    public Page<DocumentVO> listDocuments(DocumentVO document) {
        LambdaQueryWrapper<DocumentEntity> qw = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();
        if (document.getFileName() != null) {
            qw.like(DocumentEntity::getFileName, document.getFileName());
        }
        qw.eq(DocumentEntity::getBaseId, document.getKnowledgeBaseId());
        qw.orderByDesc(DocumentEntity::getCreateTime);
        
        Page<DocumentEntity> page = Page.of(document.getPageNo(), document.getPageSize());
        Page<DocumentEntity> documentPage = documentEntityMapper.selectPage(page, qw);
        
        // 转换为VO并补充文件URL
        List<DocumentVO> vos = documentPage.getRecords().stream().map(item -> {
            OriginFileResource resource = originFileResourceMapper
                .selectById(item.getResourceId());
            String path = objectStoreService.getTmpFileUrl(
                resource.getBucketName(), resource.getObjectName());
            
            DocumentVO vo = new DocumentVO();
            BeanUtils.copyProperties(item, vo);
            vo.setPath(path);
            vo.setFileType(resource.getContentType());
            return vo;
        }).toList();
        
        Page<DocumentVO> res = new Page<>();
        BeanUtils.copyProperties(documentPage, res);
        res.setRecords(vos);
        return res;
    }

    @Override
    public Boolean deleteKnowledgeFile(DocumentVO documentVO) {
        // 1. 删除数据库记录
        documentEntityMapper.deleteById(documentVO.getId());
        
        // 2. 删除向量数据库中的向量
        VectorStore vectorStore = llmService.getVectorStore();
        Filter.Expression filterExpression = new FilterExpressionBuilder()
            .eq("document_id", documentVO.getId()).build();
        SearchRequest searchRequest = SearchRequest.defaults()
            .withTopK(10000)
            .withFilterExpression(filterExpression);
        
        List<Document> documents = vectorStore.similaritySearch(searchRequest);
        if (!documents.isEmpty()) {
            List<String> ids = documents.stream()
                .map(Document::getId).toList();
            vectorStore.delete(ids);
        }
        return true;
    }

    @Override
    public void download(Long fileId, HttpServletResponse response) {
        DocumentEntity document = documentEntityMapper.selectById(fileId);
        OriginFileResource resource = originFileResourceMapper
            .selectById(document.getResourceId());
        
        // 从MinIO获取文件流
        InputStream file = minIOService.getFile(
            resource.getBucketName(), resource.getObjectName());
        
        // 设置响应头
        response.setContentType("application/octet-stream");
        response.setHeader("Content-Disposition", 
            "attachment; filename=\"" + 
            URLEncoder.encode(resource.getFileName(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8) + "\"");
        
        // 写入响应流
        try (ServletOutputStream out = response.getOutputStream()) {
            byte[] buffer = new byte[1024];
            int length;
            while ((length = file.read(buffer)) != -1) {
                out.write(buffer, 0, length);
            }
            out.flush();
        }
    }
}
```

### 5.3 文档向量化实现

#### 5.3.1 文档解析与分割

文档向量化是RAG系统的关键环节，包括文档上传、解析、分割和向量化存储。

```java
@Service
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class OriginFileResourceServiceImpl implements OriginFileResourceService {

    private final MinIOService minIOService;
    private final VectorStore vectorStore;
    private final EmbeddingModel embeddingModel;
    private final OriginFileResourceMapper originFileResourceMapper;
    private final DocumentEntityMapper documentEntityMapper;

    @Transactional
    public String uploadAndProcess(MultipartFile file, String knowledgeBaseId) {
        // 1. 上传文件到MinIO
        String fileName = file.getOriginalFilename();
        String objectName = UUID.randomUUID().toString() + "/" + fileName;
        minIOService.uploadFile(file, "documents", objectName);
        
        // 2. 保存文件元数据
        OriginFileResource resource = new OriginFileResource();
        resource.setId(UUID.randomUUID().toString());
        resource.setFileName(fileName);
        resource.setObjectName(objectName);
        resource.setBucketName("documents");
        resource.setContentType(file.getContentType());
        resource.setSize(file.getSize());
        originFileResourceMapper.insert(resource);
        
        // 3. 创建文档记录
        DocumentEntity documentEntity = new DocumentEntity();
        documentEntity.setId(SnowflakeIdWorker.nextId());
        documentEntity.setFileName(fileName);
        documentEntity.setBaseId(knowledgeBaseId);
        documentEntity.setResourceId(resource.getId());
        documentEntity.setIsEmbedding(false);
        documentEntityMapper.insert(documentEntity);
        
        // 4. 异步处理向量化
        processDocumentAsync(documentEntity.getId(), resource.getId());
        
        return resource.getId();
    }

    @Async
    public void processDocumentAsync(Long documentId, String resourceId) {
        try {
            // 获取文件流
            OriginFileResource resource = originFileResourceMapper
                .selectById(resourceId);
            InputStream inputStream = minIOService.getFile(
                resource.getBucketName(), resource.getObjectName());
            
            // 使用Apache Tika解析文档
            Tika tika = new Tika();
            String content = tika.parseToString(inputStream);
            
            // 使用TokenTextSplitter分割文本
            TokenTextSplitter splitter = new TokenTextSplitter(
                800,    // chunkSize
                200,    // chunkOverlap
                10,     // minChunkSize
                2000,   // maxChunkSize
                true    // keepSeparator
            );
            List<String> chunks = splitter.split(content);
            
            // 生成向量并存储
            List<Document> documents = chunks.stream().map(chunk -> {
                Document doc = new Document(chunk);
                doc.getMetadata().put("document_id", documentId.toString());
                doc.getMetadata().put("knowledge_base_id", 
                    documentEntityMapper.selectById(documentId).getBaseId());
                doc.getMetadata().put("file_name", resource.getFileName());
                return doc;
            }).toList();
            
            vectorStore.add(documents);
            
            // 更新文档状态
            DocumentEntity entity = new DocumentEntity();
            entity.setId(documentId);
            entity.setIsEmbedding(true);
            documentEntityMapper.updateById(entity);
            
        } catch (Exception e) {
            log.error("文档向量化失败", e);
        }
    }
}
```

#### 5.3.2 向量存储配置

系统使用Spring AI提供的VectorStore接口与PgVector集成。

```java
@Configuration
public class VectorStoreConfig {

    @Bean
    public VectorStore vectorStore(JdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate, 
                                   EmbeddingModel embeddingModel) {
        return PgVectorStore.builder(jdbcTemplate, embeddingModel)
            .dimensions(1536)           // OpenAI Embedding维度
            .distanceType(PgVectorStore.PgDistanceType.COSINE_DISTANCE)
            .initializeSchema(true)     // 自动初始化表结构
            .build();
    }
}
```

### 5.4 前端界面实现

#### 5.4.1 AI对话界面

AI对话界面采用流式输出设计，支持文本输入、图片上传和引用来源展示。

```vue
<template>
  <div class="chat-container">
    <!-- 消息列表 -->
    <div class="message-list" ref="messageListRef">
      <div v-for="(msg, index) in messages" :key="index" 
           :class="['message', msg.role]">
        <div class="message-content">
          <div class="text" v-html="renderMarkdown(msg.content)"></div>
          <!-- 引用来源 -->
          <div v-if="msg.references && msg.references.length > 0" 
               class="references">
            <div class="reference-title">参考来源：</div>
            <div v-for="ref in msg.references" :key="ref.documentId" 
                 class="reference-item" @click="viewReference(ref)">
              <el-icon><Document /></el-icon>
              <span>{{ ref.title || ref.documentName }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- 输入区域 -->
    <div class="input-area">
      <div class="input-wrapper">
        <el-input
          v-model="inputMessage"
          type="textarea"
          :rows="3"
          placeholder="请输入问题..."
          @keydown.enter.prevent="sendMessage"
        />
        <div class="input-actions">
          <el-upload
            v-model:file-list="fileList"
            action="/api/file/upload"
            :limit="3"
            accept="image/*"
          >
            <el-button type="primary" text>
              <el-icon><Picture /></el-icon>
            </el-button>
          </el-upload>
          <el-button type="primary" @click="sendMessage" :loading="loading">
            发送
          </el-button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>

<script setup>
import { ref, onMounted, nextTick } from 'vue';
import { EventSourceParserStream } from 'eventsource-parser/stream';
import { marked } from 'marked';

const messages = ref([]);
const inputMessage = ref('');
const loading = ref(false);
const messageListRef = ref(null);

const sendMessage = async () => {
  if (!inputMessage.value.trim()) return;
  
  const userMessage = inputMessage.value;
  inputMessage.value = '';
  
  // 添加用户消息
  messages.value.push({
    role: 'user',
    content: userMessage
  });
  
  loading.value = true;
  
  try {
    const response = await fetch('/api/ai/chat/simpleRAGWithReferences', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({
        message: userMessage,
        conversationId: currentConversationId.value
      })
    });
    
    const reader = response.body
      .pipeThrough(new TextDecoderStream())
      .pipeThrough(new EventSourceParserStream())
      .getReader();
    
    // 添加AI消息占位
    const aiMessageIndex = messages.value.length;
    messages.value.push({
      role: 'assistant',
      content: '',
      references: []
    });
    
    while (true) {
      const { done, value } = await reader.read();
      if (done) break;
      
      const data = JSON.parse(value.data);
      messages.value[aiMessageIndex].content += data.content;
      if (data.references) {
        messages.value[aiMessageIndex].references = data.references;
      }
      
      // 滚动到底部
      await nextTick();
      scrollToBottom();
    }
  } finally {
    loading.value = false;
  }
};

const renderMarkdown = (content) => {
  return marked.parse(content);
};

const scrollToBottom = () => {
  messageListRef.value.scrollTop = messageListRef.value.scrollHeight;
};
</script>
```

#### 5.4.2 知识库管理界面

知识库管理界面提供了知识库列表、文档管理和上传功能。

```vue
<template>
  <div class="knowledge-base-manager">
    <!-- 知识库列表 -->
    <div class="kb-list">
      <div class="kb-header">
        <h3>知识库列表</h3>
        <el-button type="primary" @click="showCreateDialog = true">
          <el-icon><Plus /></el-icon>新建知识库
        </el-button>
      </div>
      <el-menu :default-active="selectedKbId" @select="selectKnowledgeBase">
        <el-menu-item v-for="kb in knowledgeBases" :key="kb.id" :index="kb.id">
          <el-icon><Collection /></el-icon>
          <span>{{ kb.name }}</span>
        </el-menu-item>
      </el-menu>
    </div>
    
    <!-- 文档列表 -->
    <div class="document-list">
      <div class="doc-header">
        <h3>{{ selectedKbName }} - 文档管理</h3>
        <el-upload
          action="/api/file/upload"
          :data="{ knowledgeBaseId: selectedKbId }"
          :on-success="handleUploadSuccess"
          accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,.txt"
        >
          <el-button type="primary">
            <el-icon><Upload /></el-icon>上传文档
          </el-button>
        </el-upload>
      </div>
      
      <el-table :data="documents" v-loading="loading">
        <el-table-column prop="fileName" label="文件名" />
        <el-table-column prop="fileType" label="类型" width="120" />
        <el-table-column prop="uploadTime" label="上传时间" width="180" />
        <el-table-column label="状态" width="120">
          <template #default="{ row }">
            <el-tag :type="row.isEmbedding ? 'success' : 'warning'">
              {{ row.isEmbedding ? '已向量化' : '处理中' }}
            </el-tag>
          </template>
        </el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="操作" width="200">
          <template #default="{ row }">
            <el-button type="primary" link @click="downloadFile(row)">
              下载
            </el-button>
            <el-button type="danger" link @click="deleteFile(row)">
              删除
            </el-button>
          </template>
        </el-table-column>
      </el-table>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
```

